  "subject": "Action-required (small): renumber the colliding queue item currently at CA-015 (the /fetch+ZIP observation filed 2026-05-26 ~22:38) to the next available CA-NNN after the latest decision artifact (CA-016); decisions/CA-015.md is the security handoff doctrine and must keep that ID; PO directive 2026-05-27; one-line D1 update + a refresh-counter call to advance the allocator; status memo back with the new CA-NNN when complete",

  "sent": "2026-05-27T00:30:00-04:00",
